  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The figure below shows a block of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>, kept on a rough inclined plane of angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math>&nbsp;and coefficient of static friction equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.&nbsp;It is being acted upon by two forces. What should be the minimum&nbsp;value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;(in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>) so that the block doesn't slip downwards? <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo></math>Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>ms</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>]</mo></math></p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0627072.PNG\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 122px;\" /></p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "16.25",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>F</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>mg</mtext><mi>sin</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>μ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mg</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>cos</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>0.5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>=</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>75</mn><msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>75</mn><msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>160</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>75</mn><msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><mtext>P</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>16.25</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>N</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/image3241.JPG\" style=\"width: 254px; height: 193px;\" />",
